# CI/CD = Continuous Integration / Continuous Delivery (or Deployment)

# CI - Runs automatically on code changes, checks for quality errors, prevents broken code from merging.

# CD - Takes over after code is merged, Builds docker image, Deploys to cloud, Can be auto or manual

# Why CI/CD - Faster releases, Fewer bugs in production, Immediate feedback, Confidence to ship often.

